ismissal of the paywall."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"onRequestDismiss"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A completion block containing a feature that you wish to paywall. Access to this block is remotely configurable via the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/superwall.com\/dashboard","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":". If the paywall is set to "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"Non Gated","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":", this will be called when"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the paywall is dismissed or if the user is already paying. If the paywall is ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"Gated","type":"text"}]},{"text":", this will be called only if the user is already paying","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"or if they begin paying. If no paywall is configured, this gets called immediately. This will not be called in the event of an error.","type":"text"}]}],"name":"feature"}]},{"content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"This uses ","type":"text"},{"code":"Superwall\/getPaywall(forPlacement:params:paywallOverrides:delegate:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" under the hood.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"style":"warning","type":"aside","name":"Warning","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You’re responsible for the deallocation of this view. If you have a "},{"code":"PaywallView","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" presented somewhere"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and you try to present the same "},{"code":"PaywallView","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" elsewhere, you will get a crash."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/superwall-ios.SuperwallKit\/documentation\/SuperwallKit","doc:\/\/superwall-ios.SuperwallKit\/documentation\/SuperwallKit\/Pa